ipt:launchtap(); return false;" title="USF on iTunes U" href="#">_ESOL TAPESTRY</a><br><a class="itmsLink" onclick="javascript:launchnsa(); return false;" title="USF on iTunes U" href="#">_No Strings Attached</a><br><a class="itmsLink" onclick="javascript:launchte(); return false;" title="USF on iTunes U" href="#">_Tech-Ease</a><br><br>The free <a href="https://www.apple.com/itunes/download/">iTunes application</a> for either Macintosh or Windows computers may be downloaded directly from Apple Inc.</p></td></tr></table></td><td rowspan="3" align="left" valign="top"><p><blockquote><h1>404 Page Not Found</h1>You have requested a page that either has been removed from the FCIT server or has been moved to a different address.You may link to the <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/">FCIT Homepage</A> or to one of the FCIT sites below. If you believe you have received this message in error, please e-mail the <a href="mailto:florida@coedu.usf.edu">Webmaster.</a><span class="main"><ul class="main2">  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/clipart/"><b>ClipArt ETC:</b> Over 65,000 royalty-free illustrations for classroom use</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/clippix/"><b>ClipPix ETC:</b> Thousands of royalty-free stock photographs for classroom use</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/"><b>Educational Technology Clearinghouse:</b> lesson plans, standards, resources</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/florida/"><b>Exploring Florida:</b> Social studies, language arts, <nobr>&amp; science</nobr> resources for students &amp; teachers</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/express/"><b>FCAT Express:</b> Reading Practice</a><br>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/fcat/">[Grade 4]</a> <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/fcat8r/">[Grade 8]</a> <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/fcat10r/">[Grade 10]</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/florida/maps/"><b>Florida Maps:</b> Over 6,000 historic &amp; contemporary Florida maps for classroom use</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/lit2go/"><b>Lit2Go:</b> Over 4,500 audio files of K-12 literature along with print resources &amp; activities</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/maps/"><b>Maps ETC:</b> Over 5,000 royalty-free historic maps from around the world</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/presentations/"><b>Presentations ETC:</b> Thousands of backgrounds, buttons, letters, and other presentation extras.</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/holocaust/"><b>Teacher's Guide to the Holocaust:</b> photographs, documents, art, music, &amp; literature</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/techease/"><b>Tech-Ease:</b> Just-in-time classroom tech help</a><br>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/techease/mac/">[For Macintosh]</a> <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/techease/win/">[For Windows]</a> <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/techease/4all/">[4All]</a>  </li>  </ul>  <ul class="main3">  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/assessment/">Classroom Assessment</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/classprojects/" title="Class Projects ETC">ClassProjects ETC</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/clipaudio/galleries/" title="Clipaudio ETC">ClipAudio ETC</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/dtl/">Digital Teaching and Learning</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/network/">Educator's Guide to School Networking</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://tapestry.usf.edu/">ESOL TAPESTRY</a> and <a href="https://tapestry.usf.edu/journal/">ESOL TAPESTRY Journal</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/fcat5m/">FCAT Math Grade 5</a> and <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/fcat8m/">FCAT Math Grade 8</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://fcit.usf.edu/wwii/">Florida Goes to War: The Sunshine State in WWII</a>  </li>  <li>    <a href="https://etc.usf.edu/lplanner/" title="FCIT LPlanner">LPlanner</a>  </li>  <li>